rsible-pump22095345016.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">SS Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>ss submersible pump Through more than 20 years’ hard working, our company has become one of the best pump companies in Taizhou, Zhejiang province. JIADI pumps are all quality enough to be sold out to more than 70 countries around the world. And ss submersible pump is widely known by our...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52198500\"/></p><p><strong>ss submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241517026672031.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Through more than 20 years’ hard working, our company has become one of the best pump companies in Taizhou, Zhejiang province. JIADI pumps are all quality enough to be sold out to more than 70 countries around the world. And ss submersible pump is widely known by our customers.</p><p><strong>1. Product Description</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Brand</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Structure</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Multistage Pump</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Volt</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220V-240V/380-415V</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Speed</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2850 r/m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4SPD3</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Head</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">14-328 m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Capacity</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-4 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.37-4kW/ 0.5-5.5HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Impeller material</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">98 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">603-1870 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">G 1 1/4 &amp;ldquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Protection Grade</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP 68</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Insulation Class</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">12 Months Limited</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"